Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Asks Windows Error Reporting for a mini dump when brp.exe dies, so a fault in
; native code (FFmpeg, the GPU driver, WASAPI) leaves a stack behind. The panic
; hook cannot see those: the process is gone before Rust unwinds.
;
; Right-click > Merge, then accept the administrator prompt. Dumps land in
; %LOCALAPPDATA%\CrashDumps. To undo, delete the brp.exe key below.
;
; Scoped to brp.exe on purpose. If no dump ever appears, the same two values
; under the parent LocalDumps key turn the feature on for every application.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\Windows Error Reporting\LocalDumps\brp.exe]
"DumpType"=dword:00000001
"DumpCount"=dword:00000003
